---
title: Computer Organisation and Design
subtitle: From a Pebble to a Processor
meta: 50 classes · 8 arcs · 1 processor · Chanakya University · EAI213
live: 27

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# One list, one place to fix a filename.
#   file:  the deck in /courses/cod/  (omit it and the row renders as "coming")
